   "text": "Mediadesign University of Applied Sciences - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nMediadesign University of Applied Sciences\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nMediadesign University of Applied Sciences was one of the first universities in Germany to establish degree programmes in game design, film animation and digital media. Since the 1990s, we have focused on innovative teaching formats and technological integration - from satellite teaching to AI-supported learning. This early focus has made us a pioneer for future-oriented degree programmes at the interface of creativity and technology. Study where innovation happens: Our campus locations in Düsseldorf at the Media Harbour and in the center of Berlin offer an inspiring environment with state-of-the-art facilities - perfect for creative work and networking.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n29/04/2026 07:42\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n06/10/2025 10:32\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nGermany\nYearly Fees\nMax: €15,000.00\nMin: €9,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n50%\n250 of 500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nDüsseldorf, Berlin\nCountry\nGermany\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n19/09/2025\nContract End Date\n18/09/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nExpiring in 60 days\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.mediadesign.de/en/funding\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/MediadesignDe\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
